              "value": "Nixbrix has a custom-built, extra-large firearm mounted to the shoulder of his custom armor.\n\nOnly he knows how to fire the contraption, which is inscrutable in the hands of anyone else. Whenever Nixbrix fires his Really Big Gun, the armor automatically reloads the weapon, but it doesn't finish reloading until the end of his next turn. He can only fire it, at most, every other round. He can take 6 shots with this weapon before all the ammunition is spent."
            },
